			text = [=[In a corridor of the great temple hall of {link:uldaman}Uldaman{/link} lie the remains of a human paladin. He came to the {link:badlands}Badlands{/link} on a quest of his own choosing, to purge an evil taint he believed lay over the dig site. He wore a fine magical necklace made for him by Talvash del Kissel, a {link:gnomes}gnome{/link} jeweler of {link:ironforge}Ironforge{/link}. He died in the vault, and his necklace was broken and its gems scattered. His bloodstained journal, written in the tongue of humans, lies beside him.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Significance",
			text = [=[The paladin's death had a long shadow. A rival of Talvash put it about that the necklace had cursed its wearer, and the jeweler's trade was ruined. In the {link:horde}Horde{/link}, the salvagers of Droffers and Son heard of the necklace too, and wanted it.]=],
		},
